Comment: 0,0:09:09.99,0:09:10.61,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-CinemaCN\fs80\bord3\pos(968,876)}你覺得很開心吧！
Comment: 0,0:09:11.03,0:09:11.99,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-CinemaCN\fs80\bord3\pos(968,876)}很光榮吧！
Comment: 0,0:12:20.55,0:12:22.86,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-CinemaCN\fs80\bord3\pos(968,876)}穆亞
Comment: 0,0:16:13.24,0:16:13.87,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-CinemaCN\fs80\bord3\pos(968,876)}好… 好的！
Comment: 0,0:16:41.84,0:16:43.11,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-CinemaCN\fs80\bord3\pos(968,876)}穆亞
